【第{{@集}}集·段{{段}}】
【全局视觉风格】
{{@风格锁}}
【画面质感——高优先级】
像一部用35mm胶片实拍的电影，不是CG动画：{{材质}}；{{@颜色句}}
【实拍特效规范——高优先级】
PRACTICAL EFFECTS ONLY. Every effect must look physically shot in camera on a film set on 35mm film, never added in post.
1. {{光源}} Every light lights its surroundings: faces, hands, {{空气里的东西}} and the air itself, the light falling off into deep darkness. Nothing glows without lighting the world around it. {{@特效固定1}} {{@特效固定2}}
{{@FACING}}
2. Matter in the air: {{空气}}; shoot through {{前景}} so that everything feels photographed in one real space.
3. Each kind of contact has its own effect. {{接触特效}}
4. Real lens and real film: highlights bloom and halate with a red-orange halo, slight chromatic fringing, softer focus at the frame edges, heavy motion blur and step-printed smearing on fast action, film grain and faint scratches; the {{高光}} highlights {{@胶片后半}}
5. Restraint: a few large, motivated effects rather than many small ones. Every effect has a physical cause and a physical consequence.
{{@资产行}}
{{@场景块}}
【人物与表演——高优先级】
SMALL AND TRUE: real people, a camera very close; two to four small physical signals at a time, never mimed, never a blank face. {{@险情三层}}
{{@人物句}}
Every named character appears exactly once.
ENGLISH ONLY: every spoken word is in {{@语言}}, never Chinese; background people make only wordless sounds ({{背景声词|gasps, breath}}).{{@台词声明短}}
【险情——最高优先级】
STEADY HAZARD: the camera stands on solid ground and stays steady; it does not fly, fall or tumble. What moves is the people, the glass and the debris. The camera only reacts with a small jolt when something heavy lands close to it.
HAZARD LOGIC: {{逻辑}}
{{@险情表情}}
【镜头衔接——高优先级】
{{@镜头数}} SHOTS, hard cuts only at {{@切点}} s. Every cut is matched on action: each shot opens exactly where the last one ended; no action restarts after a cut. 180-degree rule: {{轴线}}; the camera never crosses the line between them.
TALL FRAME: the frame is tall and narrow. Whatever falls, falls down the height of the frame; whoever reaches, reaches along it. Faces and hands that matter stay in the upper two thirds of the frame.
UPRIGHT: the camera is always level and the right way up: the floor at the bottom of the frame, gravity pulling down, heads above feet.
ONE IMAGE: every shot is one continuous image of one real space through one lens: no split screen, no panels, no picture in picture, no double exposure.
【本段战损】
BATTLE DAMAGE: at the start {{战损开场}}. Each wound appears only at the moment it is dealt, then stays to the end: {{战损新增}}.
{{@镜头}}
【结束状态】
END STATE: the last frame is the end of shot {{@末镜号}}: {{结束}}
{{@结尾固定}}
不生成BGM：不要音乐、配乐、旋律，只保留{{@BGM对白}}呼吸声、{{环境声}}和动作的声音。
Practical in-camera effects only: {{实拍特效}}. No glowing energy, no light beams, no particle-system effects, no video-game effects.
